    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yukimura</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Buried in snow. Haunted by whispers. Forgotten by time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a remote mountain village, you must survive the long nights as ancient spirits stir beneath the snow. By day, you gather supplies and decipher a mysterious journal. By night, you hide, perform rituals, and try to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by traditional Japanese folklore and gassho-zukuri architecture, Yukimura blends atmospheric horror with survival and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted snow-covered village inspired by Shirakawa-go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden folklore through artifacts, rituals, and journal entries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage warmth, light, and time \u2014 each decision can mean survival or death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face supernatural threats that evolve with each passing night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a chilling world of isolation, memory, and myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372200/extras/f17c2d5a2fdcbc669240ccba6fc84157.avif?t=1752534027\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yukimura</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Buried in snow. Haunted by whispers. Forgotten by time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a remote mountain village, you must survive the long nights as ancient spirits stir beneath the snow. By day, you gather supplies and decipher a mysterious journal. By night, you hide, perform rituals, and try to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by traditional Japanese folklore and gassho-zukuri architecture, Yukimura blends atmospheric horror with survival and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted snow-covered village inspired by Shirakawa-go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden folklore through artifacts, rituals, and journal entries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage warmth, light, and time \u2014 each decision can mean survival or death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face supernatural threats that evolve with each passing night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a chilling world of isolation, memory, and myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372200/extras/f17c2d5a2fdcbc669240ccba6fc84157.avif?t=1752534027\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
